</div>

## Secondary

Accent color. Used to emphasize actions (like a button a user can click) and highlighted information. Use <b>sparingly</b>!

<div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:20px;margin:20px auto;font-size:14pt;">

  <div style="width:180px;border:1px solid #000000;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;">
